{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしと、あたし。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北川社長がわざわざ撮ってくれました\\( ˆoˆ )/笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社長、さりげなくブレてますよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログはたくさんの祝福をありがとう！！(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからコメントは全部結果発表の直前に見て\n気持ちを上げてたっ(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の支え\\( ˆoˆ )/！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも期待に応えられるように\nがんばるっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は昼も夜も栄さんに立候補。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昼には女中6になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栄には、誠一とは違う役も演じたくて立候補したんですけど、\n残念ながら役にはなれなくて(´._.`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しかったけどななみんには納得！\nそして感心！\n頭がいいから切り返しが早くて上手いから\n学ぶところがいっぱいです\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼には女中に初めてなることができてっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったし、楽しかったし、衣装も可愛いし、\nこの物語をゆるがす女中は楽しんでできました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は昼も夜も誠一さんに立候補。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして夜には女中3になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼は一幕で悔いなく演じられたから\n二幕出れなくてもやり切った！！って思ってたんだけど、\nやっぱり悔しかったな。うん。\nちっくしょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからライブのときに愛未と鬱憤を晴らすように\nもう全力で、ただひたすら全力で\nシャキイズムを踊りましたよ。笑ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、もう一回リベンジだ！って思って\n夜も誠一立候補したけど\nまさかのまさかのまさかすぎる飛鳥に誠一をやられてしまって！\n驚いた！細かった！サイズ感！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女中3を頑張りました♡！！\n3は特に目立つところが多くて楽しいんだよ～\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり夜も悔しかったけど、\nやっぱりどこかやりきれてないところがあって。\nだからもっとこうしたら良かったなーとか後悔がうまれちゃって。\nもやもやしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから明日の一幕からは\n絶対後悔だけはしないように\n全力でやり抜きます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の役。\n毎回すごく悩むんだけどねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からはまた、新しい、挑戦をしようかと、考えてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その有志だけでも見ててくれたら嬉しい！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるぞ！おー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーちゃんいくちゃんちーちゃん\nめーちゃん故にひめーちゃん故にめーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてっ今日の夜は、\nさいとうさんたち、ちーむN、中3組、\nみんなで二幕にでることができたっ♡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくいい思い出になったよ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からも、また一緒に出られたら嬉しいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/06/5236800/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p